AppTooltipCustom:
Enter values separated by "|". Possible values:
'1' = enable custom mode;
'2' = manage offline mode;
'3=10' = force synchronization of seed type products (seed product code: 10);
'4' = force synchronization of species, variety and purpose for offline mode;
'5=' + country code = country code;
6 = sort species/varieties showing those of the plants first;
'7' = force synchronization of suppliers;
'8=' + country code = address control;
'9' = surface area in hectares (Ha)
